### 采购计划 API 测试文件
### 使用 VS Code REST Client 插件运行

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@userId = test-user-001
@salesContractId = clxxx-sales-contract-id
@planId = clxxx-plan-id
@itemId = clxxx-item-id

### ============================================
### 1. 获取采购计划列表（分页）
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans?page=1&pageSize=20
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### ============================================
### 2. 获取采购计划列表（带筛选）
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans?planStatus=DRAFT&buyer=张三&search=PP2026
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### ============================================
### 3. 获取采购计划详情
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/{{planId}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### ============================================
### 4. 创建采购计划
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "code": "PP202602070001",
  "planDate": "2026-02-07T00:00:00.000Z",
  "expectedDeliveryDate": "2026-03-07T00:00:00.000Z",
  "planStatus": "DRAFT",
  "approvalStatus": "PENDING",
  "customerId": "customer-001",
  "customerCode": "C001",
  "buyer": "张三",
  "salesPerson": "李四",
  "merchandiser": "王五",
  "isAccessoryPurchase": false,
  "salesType": "DOMESTIC",
  "remark": "测试采购计划",
  "items": {
    "create": [
      {
        "lineNumber": 1,
        "productCode": "P001",
        "productName": "产品A",
        "specification": "100*200*300",
        "purchaseQuantity": 100,
        "pendingQuantity": 100,
        "unitPrice": 50.00,
        "currency": "CNY",
        "deliveryDate": "2026-03-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "supplierCode": "S001",
        "supplierName": "供应商A"
      },
      {
        "lineNumber": 2,
        "productCode": "P002",
        "productName": "产品B",
        "specification": "50*100*150",
        "purchaseQuantity": 200,
        "pendingQuantity": 200,
        "unitPrice": 30.00,
        "currency": "CNY",
        "deliveryDate": "2026-03-05T00:00:00.000Z",
        "supplierCode": "S002",
        "supplierName": "供应商B"
      }
    ]
  }
}

### ============================================
### 5. 从销售合同生成采购计划
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/from-sales-contract/{{salesContractId}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### ============================================
### 6. 更新采购计划主数据
### ============================================
PUT {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/{{planId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "buyer": "赵六",
  "expectedDeliveryDate": "2026-03-15T00:00:00.000Z",
  "remark": "更新交期和采购员"
}

### ============================================
### 7. 添加采购计划明细
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/{{planId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "productCode": "P003",
  "productName": "产品C",
  "specification": "200*300*400",
  "purchaseQuantity": 150,
  "pendingQuantity": 150,
  "unitPrice": 80.00,
  "currency": "CNY",
  "deliveryDate": "2026-03-10T00:00:00.000Z",
  "supplierId": "supplier-003",
  "supplierCode": "S003",
  "supplierName": "供应商C",
  "purchaseType": "NORMAL",
  "includeTax": true,
  "taxRate": 13.00
}

### ============================================
### 8. 更新采购计划明细
### ============================================
PUT {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/{{planId}}/items/{{itemId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "purchaseQuantity": 250,
  "unitPrice": 45.00,
  "supplierName": "供应商A（新）"
}

### ============================================
### 9. 删除采购计划明细
### ============================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/{{planId}}/items/{{itemId}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### ============================================
### 10. 审核通过采购计划
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/{{planId}}/approve
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### ============================================
### 11. 拒绝采购计划
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/{{planId}}/reject
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "reason": "采购价格过高，需要重新询价"
}

### ============================================
### 12. 取消采购计划
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/{{planId}}/cancel
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### ============================================
### 13. 删除采购计划
### ============================================
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/{{planId}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### ============================================
### 14. 获取采购计划统计
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/statistics?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### ============================================
### 15. 获取指定客户的采购计划统计
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/statistics?customerId=customer-001&buyer=张三
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### ============================================
### 测试场景：完整业务流程
### ============================================

### Step 1: 从销售合同生成采购计划
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/from-sales-contract/{{salesContractId}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### Step 2: 查看生成的采购计划详情
# 使用 Step 1 返回的 planId
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/{{planId}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### Step 3: 补充供应商信息
PUT {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/{{planId}}/items/{{itemId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "supplierId": "supplier-001",
  "supplierCode": "S001",
  "supplierName": "优质供应商A",
  "unitPrice": 48.50
}

### Step 4: 提交审核（更新状态）
PUT {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/{{planId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "planStatus": "PENDING"
}

### Step 5: 审核通过
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/{{planId}}/approve
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### Step 6: 查看统计数据
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/statistics
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### ============================================
### 错误场景测试
### ============================================

### 尝试删除已审核的采购计划（应该失败）
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/{{planId}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### 尝试审核已审核的采购计划（应该失败）
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/{{planId}}/approve
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### 尝试从不存在的销售合同生成采购计划（应该失败）
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/from-sales-contract/invalid-id
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### 尝试获取不存在的采购计划（应该失败）
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchase-plans/invalid-id
x-user-id: {{userId}}
